From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas De Marchi <ldemarchi@nvidia.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Jan 2026 15:27:14 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: security/apparmor: Fix AA_DEBUG_PROFILE define

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2138131

Properly pass the variadic arguments so it can be called with or without
them depending on the format.

Signed-off-by: Lucas De Marchi <ldemarchi@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Abdur Rahman <abdur.rahman@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00409
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-6.17@a2400e417866217d00dfc4c74244632de15adf34
---
 security/apparmor/include/lib.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/security/apparmor/include/lib.h b/security/apparmor/include/lib.h
index c85120e25295..b95f86b2cd45 100644
--- a/security/apparmor/include/lib.h
+++ b/security/apparmor/include/lib.h
@@ -54,9 +54,9 @@ extern struct aa_dfa *stacksplitdfa;
 #define AA_DEBUG_LABEL(LAB, X, fmt, args...)				\
 do {									\
 	if ((LAB)->flags & FLAG_DEBUG1)					\
-		AA_DEBUG(X, fmt);					\
+		AA_DEBUG(X, fmt, ## args);			\
 } while (0)
-#define AA_DEBUG_PROFILE(PROF, X, fmt...) AA_DEBUG_LABEL(&(PROF)->label, X, fmt)
+#define AA_DEBUG_PROFILE(PROF, X, fmt, args...) AA_DEBUG_LABEL(&(PROF)->label, X, fmt, ## args)
 
 #define AA_WARN(X) WARN((X), "APPARMOR WARN %s: %s\n", __func__, #X)
 
